# .trivyignore
# Use this file to ignore specific vulnerabilities (CVEs) found by Trivy.
# Add one CVE ID per line, optionally with a comment starting with #.
# Documentation: https://aquasecurity.github.io/trivy/latest/docs/configuration/filtering/#trivyignore

